<title>PORTUGAL: Hitachi Credit (UK) issues 3 bln esc 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Credit (UK) issues 3 bln esc 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Banco Chemical (Portugal).</p>
<p>BORROWER - Hitachi Credit (UK) Plc</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Hitachi Credit Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MANAGER - Banco Chemical (Portugal)</p>
<p>AMOUNT - 3 bln esc</p>
<p>INTEREST RATE - 10.235 pct-DEM Libor 12 mths</p>
<p>MATURITY - 25 Feb 2002</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE 100 pct</p>
<p>LIQUIDATION DATE - 25 Feb 1997</p>
<p>S&amp;P RATING - AA</p>
<p>LISTING - London</p>
<p>LAW - English</p>
<p>NOTE: Today's fixing of DEM Libor 12 mths was 3.23047 percent.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
